        "One timed practice session, mixing topics already reasonably solid, to build exam-pressure familiarity — this should increase in proportion as an exam date approaches.",
        "A short, regular review session specifically for past mistakes — not new problems, but revisiting recent wrong answers to confirm the underlying gap has actually closed.",
